    "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:TRPM8-is-a-neuronal-osmosensor-that-regulates-eye-blinking-in-mice-ncomms8150-s3.ogv",
    "original_url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/32/TRPM8-is-a-neuronal-osmosensor-that-regulates-eye-blinking-in-mice-ncomms8150-s3.ogv?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
    "license": "CC BY 4.0",
    "artist": "Quallo T, Vastani N, Horridge E, Gentry C, Parra A, Moss S, Viana F, Belmonte C, Andersson D, Bevan S",
    "description": "Supplementary Movie 2 Fura-2 responses of DRG neurons. An example of the eye blink response in a lightly restrained wild-type mouse following application of a hyperosmotic solution (790 mosm.kg-1, 10µl) to the right eye and PBS (10µl) to the left eye. A solution of higher osmotic strength was used to provide a clear demonstration of this behavioral response."
  },
